# Paste this into your repo's root CLAUDE.md

## Design system (mandatory)
All UI, pages, emails and graphics MUST follow the Meeticulous design system in `design-system/` (adjust the path):
- Read `design-system/BRAND_RULES.md` before any UI work and run its checklist before finishing.
- Use tokens from `design-system/styles.css`. Never hard-code colours, fonts, radii or shadows.
- Use components from `design-system/components/` and official files from `design-system/assets/`.
- For website restructuring, follow `design-system/WEBSITE_MIGRATION.md`.
- If a need isn't covered, extend the system (new token/component in the same style), document it in `design-system/readme.md`, then use it. Never one-off styles.
